Evidence headers show selected ranges, whose delivery requires HTTP confirmation.\",\"reading_after_write\":\"First-write prerequisites satisfied; changed-source evidence may be invalidated.\",\"required_mechanisms_exposed\":{\"deepinfer/environ.py\":{\"exposed\":0,\"registered\":3},\"deepinfer/logger.py\":{\"exposed\":0,\"registered\":0},\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\":{\"exposed\":4,\"registered\":4}}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\n\n```python\nr_env = read_file(\"deepinfer/environ.py\")\nprint(r_env[\"file_hash\"])\nprint(r_env[\"content\"])\n```"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Latest execution feedback:\nExecutor output:\nExecution logs:\na3a3ea32b36c2f1c7ea45357cff9e9be1a8b6bedb5d27a27788bc5eb1c0d25bc\n[versioned evidence retained separately]\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone\nRecent project tool results:\n[{\"tool\":\"read_symbol\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/logger.py\",\"file_hash\":\"5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\"}},{\"tool\":\"replace_text\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/environ.py\",\"file_hash\":\"a3a3ea32b36c2f1c7ea45357cff9e9be1a8b6bedb5d27a27788bc5eb1c0d25bc\",\"changed\":true}},{\"tool\":\"replace_text\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/logger.py\",\"file_hash\":\"32285fab98a1dd95fb21c21fabbc59095295e0939423405a586af317f37c9af2\",\"changed\":true}},{\"tool\":\"read_file\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/environ.py\",\"file_hash\":\"a3a3ea32b36c2f1c7ea45357cff9e9be1a8b6bedb5d27a27788bc5eb1c0d25bc\"}}]"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Evidence ev-5a3c8c1ca1246b61b813 | deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py | lines:20-20 | sha256=9ef93c3930d6dd8d889d4ba69558a85459c2210ae0714d5073c3b4328c8e